# ────────────── Fish Shell Configuration ──────────────
# This file is sourced on every interactive shell start.
# Reference: https://fishshell.com/docs/current/index.html

# Load CachyOS fish defaults — sets up aliases, prompts, fastfetch greeting,
# paru/pacman helpers, and performance tuning. See the source file at:
# /usr/share/cachyos-fish-config/cachyos-config.fish
source /usr/share/cachyos-fish-config/cachyos-config.fish

# ── Customisations ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Add your own aliases, functions, and settings below.
# Lines here run after the CachyOS defaults, so they take precedence.

# Example: override the shell greeting (replaces the fastfetch display)
# function fish_greeting
#     echo "hello"
# end

